<br/>
PDFBox currently support FDF and XFDF to populate an <br/>
AcroForm, the 7.0 version of designer does not support <br/>
either of these as a submission type.  The possiblities <br/>
are<br/>
<br/>
XDP/XFA/Full PDF/url encoded params<br/>
<br/>
There is alreadu an open RFE for XDP, this is for the <br/>
XFA format.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
See this thread for a discussion of this topic<br/>
<br/>
https://sourceforge.net/forum/message.php?<br/>
msg_id=3043621<br/>
