<br/>
It is possible to extend the PDPageContentStream, so<br/>
that is is possible, to draw a glyph with his name<br/>
(e.g, from the afm-file).<br/>
e.g.<br/>
contentStream.beginText();<br/>
contentStream.setFont(font, 12);<br/>
contentStream.moveTextPositionByAmount(100, 700);<br/>
contentStream.drawGlyph(&quot;three&quot;);<br/>
contentStream.endText();<br/>
contentStream.close();<br/>
-&gt; 3<br/>
or GylyphNotFoundException()
