http://sourceforge.net/tracker/index.php?group_id=78314&amp;atid=552835&amp;aid=1277052<br/>
Originally submitted by benlitchfield on 2005-08-30 19:37.<br/>
<br/>
Support Embedding/Extracting PNG images<br/>
<br/>
Can we utilize JAI for this.<br/>
<br/>
A comment from a PDF mailing list<br/>
<br/>
Actually, PNG-&gt;PDF with full transparency is pretty <br/>
easy.<br/>
<br/>
        PNG data is ARGB - you simply split that into an <br/>
A block and an RGB block.  The RGB data goes into <br/>
the image XObject as Flate&#39;d data - the A block as the <br/>
SMask for the image... <br/>
<br/>
Ben Litchfield
