http://sourceforge.net/tracker/download.php?group_id=78314&amp;atid=552832&amp;aid=1392196&amp;file_id=161339<br/>
testdocs.zip (application/x-zip-compressed), 74080 bytes<br/>
Contains PDF file with extracted garbled PNG image
