Originally submitted by srinivaskrishna on 2006-01-29 22:00.<br/>
<br/>
Hi,  <br/>
 <br/>
I am extracting text from pdf file and saving it in a <br/>
textfile. Each bookmark in a pdf file i am saving as a <br/>
different text file. Everything fine up to some level. <br/>
But as I am using start book mark and endbookmark as a <br/>
delimeters for pdftextstripper I am getting text <br/>
content between those bookmarks, and since one book <br/>
mark should be saved as individual file, In this text <br/>
file i am getting the first page of endbookmark which <br/>
i dont want. So can anybody suggest me the solution to <br/>
avoid the above problem. For your reference i am <br/>
pasting my code below.  <br/>
################################################## <br/>
 <br/>
import java.io.*; <br/>
import java.lang.*; <br/>
