Originally submitted by nobody on 2006-02-15 05:05.<br/>
<br/>
Hi, it should be right time now to add AES support<br/>
which is in default enabled on all encrypted PDF<br/>
documents made by Adobe Acrobat 7.0.<br/>
<br/>
Since AES is supported by java JCE it should not be a<br/>
big deal. Currently only Big Faceless PDF Library seems<br/>
to support it.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks for big help.
