http://sourceforge.net/tracker/index.php?group_id=78314&amp;atid=552832&amp;aid=1475739<br/>
Originally submitted by robertwenner on 2006-04-24 12:23.<br/>
<br/>
This code<br/>
<br/>
PDOutlineItem a = outline.getFirstChild();<br/>
PDOutlineItem b = outline.getFirstChild();<br/>
if (!a.equals(b)) {<br/>
    throw new RuntimeException(&quot;Not equal&quot;);<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
throws, because PDOutlineItem does not implement equals().<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;d like to compare nodes to each other while<br/>
traversing the outline. How do I do that without equals<br/>
or hashCode working properly?<br/>
<br/>
Thanks,<br/>
<br/>
Robert
