Originally submitted by nobody on 2006-05-09 14:29.<br/>
<br/>
In the last line of the drawString method of <br/>
org.pdfbox.pdmodel.font.PDTrueTypeFont.java, the locations are casted <br/>
to int&#39;s. This produces undesireable results when displaying a pdf.  <br/>
Removing the cast, produces more pleasant-looking font spacing.
