<br/>
Hi Ben,<br/>
<br/>
I was wondering, are you accepting member to the project? <br/>
<br/>
I&#39;m using the PDFBox for importing PDF documents and would need more formatting information that is currently supported by PDFBox. The attached is what I&#39;ve done so far: handles line breaks, bold, italics. Also added some comment delimiters for page boundaries.<br/>
<br/>
Two things I&#39;ll want to handle next are: <br/>
<br/>
1. Underline<br/>
2. Subscripts and superscripts<br/>
<br/>
Later on, I&#39;ll want to also handle the following:<br/>
<br/>
1. Images<br/>
2. Hyperlinks<br/>
3. Tables (I know this might be hard)<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ll need all the help I can get in the form of pointers and clues.<br/>
<br/>
I look forward to reading from you soon.<br/>
<br/>
Many, many thanks for providing us with a great library.<br/>
<br/>
Regards,<br/>
<br/>
Raimi Rufai<br/>
