Originally submitted by nobody on 2007-07-17 04:08.<br/>
<br/>
We are trying to extract text and images form PDF&#39;s. I have 2 PDF&#39;s which cause PDFBox to crash.  I get  null pointer exception.  The first PDF is a scanned document. The second PDF is a document that is surrounded by a table and contains images as well. These two documnets are causing PDF to get an exception.  Does anyone have any suggestions? <br/>
<br/>
[comment on SourceForge]<br/>
