Originally submitted by yt_okamoto on 2007-08-08 03:20.<br/>
<br/>
Hi Ben,<br/>
<br/>
FontBox couldn&#39;t parse some cmap files which contain &quot;cidrange&quot; property (ex. 90ms-RKSJ-H) correctly. Extract text from PDF which contain such encoding by PDFBox, it will fail as follows.<br/>
<br/>
