I neglected to mention both of these PDFs were initially image-based and were recently OCRed using Adobe Acrobat 8 Pro.  I&#39;m not sure that would matter for PDFBox to perform text extraction, but it&#39;s another commonality between these PDFs.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks in advance for any help you can provide!<br/>
