Originally submitted by nobody on 2007-10-29 17:37.<br/>
<br/>
java.io.IOException: Error getting pdf version:java.lang.NumberFormatException: For input string: &quot;-&quot;<br/>
 at org.pdfbox.pdfparser.PDFParser.parse(PDFParser.java:166)<br/>
