<br/>
Similar to PDFont, COSName caches a lot of resources that can hurt a<br/>
long-running process. This patch adds a clearResources method to COSName,<br/>
similar in intent to the one in PDFont. [ flester at gmail dot com ]<br/>
<br/>
http://sourceforge.net/tracker/download.php?group_id=78314&amp;atid=552834&amp;file_id=274060&amp;aid=1939690<br/>
