<br/>
Hi, I&#39;m trying to extract text from a pdf which can be found at<br/>
<br/>
http://www.vattenfall.com/www/vf_com/vf_com/Gemeinsame_Inhalte/DOCUMENT/360<br/>
168vatt/5965811xou/643131powe/892253fors/P0288421.pdf<br/>
