and am getting a ClassCastException from within PDFBox. The full stacktrace<br/>
is:<br/>
<br/>
java.lang.ClassCastException: org.pdfbox.cos.COSArray<br/>
at org.pdfbox.filter.FlateFilter.decode(FlateFilter.java:70)<br/>
at org.pdfbox.cos.COSStream.doDecode(COSStream.java:290)<br/>
