org.pdfbox.util.PDFTextStripper.writeText(PDFTextStripper.java:216)<br/>
at<br/>
011763f3ecc678d2org.pdfbox.util.PDFTextStripper.getText(PDFTextStripper.jav<br/>
a:149)<br/>
at [my code].<br/>
<br/>
The code leading up to the call to extract text is as follows:<br/>
<br/>
org.pdfbox.pdfparser.PDFParser parser = new<br/>
org.pdfbox.pdfparser.PDFParser(myInputStream);<br/>
<br/>
parser.parse();<br/>
<br/>
pdDocument = parser.getPDDocument();<br/>
<br/>
setContent(new PDFTextStripper().getText(pdDocument));<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
I hope the formatting is ok! Have you encountered this error before and can<br/>
you suggest any causes or solutions?<br/>
<br/>
Thanks,<br/>
Ben Kirby<br/>
kirby.bm@gmail.com<br/>
