                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;ve provided a patch to support the SC and SCN operator and it seems to be getting lost during the move from sf to apache.<br/>
<br/>
http://sourceforge.net/tracker/index.php?func=detail&amp;aid=1985243&amp;group_id=78314&amp;atid=552834<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve added limited support for the sc,scn,SC and SCN operators. Only the<br/>
following colorspaces are supported: DeviceGray, DeviceRGB, DeviceCMYK and<br/>
ICCBased.<br/>
<br/>
There are 4 new classes (oldstyle with org.pdfbox) and some additions to the configfile PageDrawer.properties<br/>
<br/>
Andreas
