  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      PDLineDashPattern should be declared as a final class or in the clone method you should call super.clone()<br/>
If another class sub-classed PDLineDashPattern, then a call to the clone method would return the incorrect type of the parent class and not the child class.<br/>
<br/>
A simple solution is to add a call to super.clone() as the first line in the clone method<br/>
<br/>
   public Object clone()<br/>
    {<br/>
        super.clone() ; // add this line to resolve the issue.<br/>
        COSArray dash = getCOSDashPattern();<br/>
        COSArray copy = new COSArray();<br/>
        copy.addAll(dash);<br/>
        PDLineDashPattern pattern = new PDLineDashPattern(copy,getPhaseStart() );<br/>
        return pattern;<br/>
    }<br/>

