                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Optional logger calls could be added to COSDocument &amp; PDJpeg  when an error occurs.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
