  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m getting the error stack below when printing out a test PDF from my application. Since the error is coming from within the sun.awt stuff, I&#39;m somewhat at a loss for how to debug. This doesn&#39;t seem to stop the PDF from rendering/printing, but the fonts on the page do look messed up, so I&#39;m trying to work through stuff and see if there&#39;s anything I can fix/improve/patch. Another thing worth noting is that this exception occurs in 1.4.2_07 (don&#39;t ask) and 1.5.0_17, but not 1.6.0_x. Also worth noting is that even with the 1.6 not giving the error, the rendering doesn&#39;t improve, so maybe this isn&#39;t something I don&#39;t need to worry about.<br/>
<br/>
Stack trace below and a sample PDF will be attached after creating the issue.<br/>
