</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Would like to improve the html output of pdf files for arabic rendering. The attached file has changes that should improve the way the -html option works. Now, output files are tagged with the .html extension. We also added &lt;DOCTYPE&gt; information as well as a &lt;meta&gt; tag which writes the appropriate encoding of the file. Cleaned up a lot of code from PDFTextStripper and PDFText2HTML which wasn&#39;t being used. Added ability to set the &lt;title&gt; tag of the html document to be the title given in the pdf document information if it exists. Otherwise it will guess a title from the beginning first lines of the file. 
  </td>
