                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Looking at another issue and running the regression test, I found that the sample_fonts_solidconverter.pdf file in the test directory has some issues producing the proper<br/>
text for two of the 9 fonts used for this line. The other fonts worked fine. <br/>
<br/>
The Produced Text: <br/>
<br/>
V e r d a n a :   T o t o   j e   p o k u s n ý   t e x t   s  <br/>
 ea t i n o u     a ~Y<br/>
 ý á í é<br/>
 <br/>
S a n s   s e r i f :   T o t o   j e   p o k u s n ý   t e x t   s  <br/>
 ea t i n o u     a <br/>
~Y ý á í é<br/>
<br/>
should be<br/>
Verdana: Toto je pokusný text s češtinou - ěščřžýáíé<br/>
Sans serif: Toto je pokusný text s češtinou - ěščřžýáíé<br/>
<br/>
I found this using the current trunk and the files in question are located in the ..\source\trunk\test\input directory.
