                <tr id="issuerow12417194" rel="12417194" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-441" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-441" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-441">PDFBOX-441</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                remove CosName nameMap cache
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sean Bridges
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sean Bridges
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 18/Mar/09 17:48 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Jul/10 07:26 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Mar/10 17:52 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        0.7.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The CosName class keeps a cache of all instances created in a static synchronized map.  I am guessing this is for performance reasons to avoid creating objects, but in our system it is causing performance problems.  We are running 7 threads extracting text from pdf&#39;s, and we can see a large number of conflicts reading from nameMap.<br/>
<br/>
The CosName map is also a potential memory leak, which forces users to periodically clear it, as noted in PDFBOX-351<br/>
<br/>
Can nameMap be removed altogether?<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
At the least, if PDSimpleFont replaced, <br/>
<br/>
 COSName.getPDFName( &quot;FontDescriptor&quot; ) <br/>
<br/>
with <br/>
<br/>
COSName.FONT_DESC<br/>
<br/>
It would reduce contention.<br/>

  </td>
