                <tr id="issuerow12417196" rel="12417196" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-442" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-442" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-442">PDFBOX-442</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                race condition in PdfFont
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sean Bridges
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sean Bridges
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 18/Mar/09 18:08 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Oct/09 09:52 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 10/May/09 17:43 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        0.7.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        0.8.0-incubator            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      this code in PDFFont.encode isn&#39;t thread safe,<br/>
<br/>
                        COSName encodingName = (COSName)encoding;<br/>
                        cmap = (CMap)cmapObjects.get( encodingName );<br/>
                        if( cmap != null )<br/>
                        {<br/>
                            cmap = (CMap)cmapObjects.get( encodingName );<br/>
                        }<br/>
<br/>
cmap may be cleared in PDFont.clearResources(), and it may be cleared in the interval between the two get() calls.  The first get() may be non null, while the second may be null.  The second get may be removed altogether.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
