<br/>
I&#39;ve read that sometimes the document is not created respecting the PDF standard. But, is there a possibility to ignore it?! In fact, it&#39;s very important to me, so, could I use PDF Box despite of those &quot;errors&quot;? <br/>
<br/>
Thank you<br/>
Marcelo<br/>

