</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Don&#39;t waste cpu resource if you don&#39;t need to log!<br/>
<br/>
There exists some lines of code like this (e.g. in PDFObjectStreamParser.java):<br/>
<br/>
    logger().fine( &quot;parsed=&quot; + object );<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
To avoid the parameter construction cost use:<br/>
<br/>
    if( logger().isLoggable(Level.FINE)  )<br/>
    {<br/>
        logger().fine( &quot;parsed=&quot; + object );<br/>
    }<br/>

  </td>
