                                            <td class="environment">      windows xp and ubuntu linux 9.04<br/>
svn at revision 785921<br/>
hp laserjet 8150 &amp; hp laserjet 1320
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When printing the attached file on either of the two mentioned printers, only empty rectangles were printed.<br/>
The Text was visible on the PDFReader preview, but was missing in the printout.<br/>
<br/>
After having read http://netstripe.com/info/appnote/app_031.html, I changed the code to rotate the page instead<br/>
of the font. Now the text is printed correctly. I will provide my changes if needed.
  </td>
