                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Due some restrictions in the license of the cmap files from adobe (see LEGAL-36) we have to remove them from svn. A standard package is already available by download  [1]. But there are still some additional cmap files left in svn which have to be removed. Most of them are included in the packages I found on [2] and [3].<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
[1] http://repo2.maven.org/maven2/com/adobe/pdf/pcfi/2009.06.14/pcfi-2009.06.14.jar<br/>
[2] ftp://ftp.oreilly.com/pub/examples/nutshell/cjkv/adobe/<br/>
[3] http://www.adobe.com/devnet/opentype/archives/glyphlist.txt<br/>

