                                            <td class="description">      The version number in the pom.xml for the JempBox 0.8-incubating release is incorrectly set to &quot;0.8.0-incubator&quot; rather than &quot;0.8.0-incubating&quot; <br/>
<br/>
Also the directory structure in the maveb2 repo is also incorrect: <br/>
<br/>
http://repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/apache/pdfbox/jempbox/0.8.0-incubator/ <br/>
<br/>
..it should be <br/>
http://repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/apache/pdfbox/jempbox/0.8.0-incubating/ <br/>
<br/>
I believe this needs a new releass to fix this.<br/>

