                <tr id="issuerow12434435" rel="12434435" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-511" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-511" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-511">PDFBOX-511</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JVM crash in PDColorSpaceInstance.createColor()
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Jukka Zitting
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jukka Zitting
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jukka Zitting
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 31/Aug/09 17:37 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Oct/09 09:52 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 14/Sep/09 11:46 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        0.7.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        0.8.0-incubator            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        PDModel            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Java HotSpot(TM) Client VM (11.3-b02 mixed mode windows-x86), Windows XP Build 2600 Service Pack 3
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Similar to PDFBOX-488, the JVM  (here JDK 1.6 on Windows XP) crashes when PDFBox tries to create a java.awt.Color instance with some specific ICC profile. The root cause of the problem is a low-level bug in the JVM (most likely http://bugs.sun.com/bugdatabase/view_bug.do?bug_id=6645513), but it would be really good if PDFBox could work around that issue or at least throw a normal exception in troublesome cases instead of crashing the entire JVM.<br/>
<br/>
See below for the relevant parts of the crash report.<br/>
<br/>
#<br/>
# An unexpected error has been detected by Java Runtime Environment:<br/>
#<br/>
#  EXCEPTION_ACCESS_VIOLATION (0xc0000005) at pc=0x6d17205d, pid=1512, tid=1324<br/>
#<br/>
# Java VM: Java HotSpot(TM) Client VM (11.3-b02 mixed mode windows-x86)<br/>
