                <tr id="issuerow12434929" rel="12434929" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-514" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-514" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-514">PDFBOX-514</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                maven pom&#39;s do not include source artifacts
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Jukka Zitting
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Yonas Jongkind
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Yonas Jongkind
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 06/Sep/09 07:50 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Feb/10 18:27 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Oct/09 09:48 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        0.8.0-incubator            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        FontBox,                     JempBox            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      For pdfbox, fontbox, and jempbox I have added the following lines to my POM&#39;s. This way when eclipse adds them to my classpath it also picks up the source.<br/>
<br/>
Essentially the following lines tell maven that when running a maven:install to also jar up the source files and include those in the distribution.<br/>
<br/>
	&lt;plugins&gt;<br/>
		&lt;plugin&gt;<br/>
		   &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.maven.plugins&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
		   &lt;artifactId&gt;maven-source-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
		   &lt;executions&gt;<br/>
			   &lt;execution&gt;<br/>
				   &lt;id&gt;attach-sources&lt;/id&gt;<br/>
				   &lt;goals&gt;<br/>
					   &lt;goal&gt;jar&lt;/goal&gt;<br/>
				   &lt;/goals&gt;<br/>
				&lt;/execution&gt;<br/>
			&lt;/executions&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/plugin&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/plugins&gt;
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
