                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      A standard java.awt.Graphics2D.drawImage() call in org.apache.pdfbox.util.operator.pagedrawer.Invoke.process() can result in the following JVM crash on Sun Java 1.5.0_19-b02. This problem doesn&#39;t affect Java 6 and seems to only occur in fairly specific circumstances.<br/>
<br/>
I couldn&#39;t find an existing Sun Java bug report about this exact problem, so I filed a new issue to them. No public bug reference is yet available.<br/>
<br/>
