                <tr id="issuerow12435459" rel="12435459" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-526" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-526" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-526">PDFBOX-526</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add ability to read encrypted file &amp; write unencrypted flie
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Jukka Zitting
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Adam Nichols
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Adam Nichols
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Sep/09 19:21 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Feb/10 18:27 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 10/Feb/10 18:21 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        PDModel,                     Writing            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently, the COSWriter determines whether or not to use encryption, which makes sense, however there&#39;s no way to tell it you don&#39;t want to use encryption.  So if you open an encrypted document, there&#39;s no way to write out an unencrypted document (you can write out a document without a password, but it&#39;ll still be encrypted).  This means that encrypted documents can&#39;t be merged even if the password is known.<br/>
<br/>
I have a patch which will allow writing out unencrypted documents.  By default it&#39;ll work as it did before, but there&#39;s a new function which can be called to mark the document to be written out with no protection.  I&#39;ll upload the patch soon.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
