1275 [main] INFO org.apache.pdfbox.util.PDFStreamEngine  - unsupported/disabled operation: RG<br/>
INFO  [main]: unsupported/disabled operation: RG<br/>
1536 [main] INFO org.apache.pdfbox.util.PDFStreamEngine  - unsupported/disabled operation: f*<br/>
INFO  [main]: unsupported/disabled operation: f*<br/>

