                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When I merge to PDFs into one using PDFMerger the Destinations of the second PDF given are being lost.<br/>
<br/>
I looked into PDFMergerUtility class and found that mergeInto called on Names&#39; COSDictionary doesn&#39;t work as intended.<br/>
<br/>
I tried to solve this problem, see the attached patch. Now I get both Destinations in the result PDF. <br/>
<br/>
Please review &amp; correct my lines before importing.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

