                                            <td class="description">      Whenever a pdf is printed java uses a 2-pass-algo to create each page. The first pass using sun.print.PeekGraphics works fine, but during the second pass using sun.print.PSPathGraphics an exception occurs if the pdf includes an image.<br/>
