                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-81                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      So far a JPXDecode filter for decoding JPEG2000 images stored as XObjects is not implemented.<br/>
I have implemented a simple decode filter using jai-imageio library from https://jai-imageio.dev.java.net/ (see attachment).<br/>
It is only a first base feature implementation since no changes to image dictionary are respected as well as special color space handling.<br/>
Unfortunately I cannot provide you with a PDF document containing such images since the document where I stumbled upon the missing feature is confidential.<br/>

  </td>
