                                            <td class="description">      Here the Highlighter Demo (pdfbox.war) didn&#39;t work (no highlighting) until I changed the ASF comment on the top of this file into a JSP comment. Thus this comment no more appears in the result stream (which is denoted &#39;XML&#39; bit in fact isn&#39;t!)
