                <tr id="issuerow12440404" rel="12440404" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-558" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-558" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-558">PDFBOX-558</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                PDPageDestination getPageNumber only returns page number when underlying COSArray has a page number
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Jukka Zitting
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Wulf Berschin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Wulf Berschin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Nov/09 11:07 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Feb/10 18:28 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 09/Feb/10 00:15 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        0.8.0-incubator            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        PDModel            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When a PDPagesDestinatin has a page referenced, getPageNumber returns (as specified) -1.<br/>
<br/>
In contrast  other PD-Objects like PDOutlineItem are more &quot;user-friendly&quot; findDestinationPage resloves thze stored reference. In my attached patch I added code to getPageNumber  to return the page number for referenced PDPages too.<br/>
<br/>
PDFBox Developers: Submit it to the code base if this fits the idea of the PD-classes.
  </td>
