                                            <td class="description">      Added another constructor that allows for the use of a memory buffer instead. Better for my usage and less clutter in the temp directory by far.<br/>
<br/>
$ diff -w &#39;C:/Users/yonasj/AppData/Local/Temp/PDDocument.java-revBASE.svn000.tmp.java&#39; &#39;C:/dev/pdfbox/pdfbox/src/main/java/org/apache/pdfbox/pdmodel/PDDocument.java&#39;<br/>
