                <tr id="issuerow12442043" rel="12442043" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-573" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-573" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-573">PDFBOX-573</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Maven build does not download files not inclued in the distribution
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Jukka Zitting
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Yonas Jongkind
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Yonas Jongkind
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/Dec/09 04:10 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Feb/10 18:28 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/Dec/09 12:36 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The following plug-in call seems to be the best thing. Just run ant directly. There does not seem to be a maven equivalent for getting files from a server.<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;build&gt;<br/>
    &lt;plugins&gt;<br/>
      &lt;plugin&gt;<br/>
        &lt;artifactId&gt;maven-antrun-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
        &lt;executions&gt;<br/>
          &lt;execution&gt;<br/>
            &lt;phase&gt;generate-sources&lt;/phase&gt;<br/>
            &lt;configuration&gt;<br/>
              &lt;tasks&gt;<br/>
				&lt;ant antfile=&quot;build.xml&quot; target=&quot;get.adobefiles&quot;/&gt;<br/>
              &lt;/tasks&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/configuration&gt;<br/>
            &lt;goals&gt;<br/>
              &lt;goal&gt;run&lt;/goal&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/goals&gt;<br/>
          &lt;/execution&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/executions&gt;<br/>
         &lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
                       &lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
                           &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.ant&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
                           &lt;artifactId&gt;ant-nodeps&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
                           &lt;version&gt;1.7.1&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
                       &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
<br/>
      &lt;/plugin&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/plugins&gt;<br/>
<br/>
And the build.xml need to be modified from:<br/>
    &lt;target name=&quot;find.adobefiles&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;available property=&quot;adobefiles.found&quot; file=&quot;${dest.dir}/Resources&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/target&gt;<br/>
<br/>
to:<br/>
    &lt;target name=&quot;find.adobefiles&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;available property=&quot;adobefiles.found&quot; file=&quot;${dest.dir}/Resources/cmap&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/target&gt;<br/>
  
  </td>
