</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-665,                                                PDFBOX-766,                                                PDFBOX-767                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      any
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The pdfbox support team asked me to post this message on this forum so attachments could be seen<br/>
<br/>
I have a pdf document that has a white background with black text. It<br/>
appears after I make the call to convertToImage the colors are reversed. A<br/>
black background with white text<br/>
