                                            <td class="environment">      Win XP
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hello ,<br/>
 <br/>
I have a PDF file with 1 page only, when I try to extract its text using :<br/>
String pageData = stripper.getText( pdfFile );<br/>
<br/>
It ignores some Enter characters between lines, so the last word in the line and the first word in the next line appear as 1 word without spaces between them !!<br/>
<br/>
While if I copy the PDF text manually from the PDF and paste it in a text editor, Enter characters appear after the same lines that caused the problem in PDFBox.<br/>
<br/>
Please check the attached file as a sample.<br/>
 <br/>
Is there a way to fix this ?<br/>
 <br/>
Best regards ,
