  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      During parsing / text extraction the PDPage class&#39; getMediaBox() and getParent() methods are accessed many times.  They are currently slow because the code recalculates the results each time.<br/>
<br/>
These should instead be persisted in instance fields so that they are only calculated once unless the underlying object state has changed.<br/>
<br/>
I will attach a version of the file that includes the fix.
