</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-622" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-622">PDFBOX-622</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Bad required namespace prefix for XMPSchemaPDFAId
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Andreas Lehmkühler
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Guillaume Bailleul
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Guillaume Bailleul
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 15/Feb/10 15:42 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Jul/10 07:26 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Jun/10 11:09 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JempBox            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In the ISO 19005 standard, the namespace prefix is &quot;pdfaid&quot; for the namespace &quot;http://www.aiim.org/pdfa/ns/id/&quot;. In this case, this prefix is required, and not preferred (as it is for dublin core for instance).<br/>
<br/>
The constructor of XMPSchemaPDFAId should be changed from &quot;pdfaType&quot; to &quot;pdfaid&quot;
  </td>
