                                            <td class="description">      maven is giving me &quot;CHECKSUM FAILED&quot; warnings for jempbox-1.0.0.jar .  The checksum file<br/>
http://repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/apache/pdfbox/jempbox/1.0.0/jempbox-1.0.0.jar.md5<br/>
contains the following:<br/>
jempbox-1.0.0.jar: C1 83 87 F9 1F A8 66 DA  2D E4 2C A6 61 FE D3 D5<br/>
That&#39;s the right checksum, but the format of the file is wrong.  The checksum files of other packages, e.g.<br/>
http://repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/apache/pdfbox/pdfbox/1.0.0/pdfbox-1.0.0.jar.md5<br/>
contain only the checksum, not the filename, and use lowercase letters and no spaces.
