                <tr id="issuerow12457745" rel="12457745" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-642" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-642" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-642">PDFBOX-642</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Make CMap entries accessible
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Trivial
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Eric Leleu
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Eric Leleu
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/Mar/10 14:40 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/Feb/12 19:18 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 14/Feb/12 19:18 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.6.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        FontBox            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
In some cases, it could be useful to access cmap entries (like WMode or CMapName) when using the CMap object.<br/>
In the current version, only CID ranges are accessible.<br/>
<br/>
This patch creates a Map that is loaded by the CMapParser (modification in &quot;parse&quot; method) . An accessor is added in the CMap class.<br/>
<br/>
Regards
  </td>
