</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-1854                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The pdfBox maven build uses ant to fetch resources remotely rather than use maven methods for this. The ant script doesn&#39;t respect the maven proxy settings so the script can&#39;t be used behind a firewall. This requires explicit proxy settings in the MAVEN_OPTS:<br/>
<br/>
export MAVEN_OPTS=&quot;-Dhttp.proxyHost=my.proxyhost -Dhttp.proxyPort=8080&quot;<br/>
<br/>
as this is not the maven way it may confuse many who try to build the source
  </td>
