                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Peter Zavadsky reported to PDFBox users&#39; mailing list about unsatisfiable results when trying to perform text extraction from the following Slovak language PDF document:<br/>
http://www.justice.gov.sk/kop/ovest/ov10/03/050/OV050A.pdf<br/>
<br/>
While I&#39;m not expert enough to say anything about text extraction, I clearly see numerous rendering problems. Please take a look at the image attachment frontpage.png<br/>
<br/>
Quite obviously, Slovak language makes use of custom character encoding schemes.
  </td>
