</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi, <br/>
<br/>
I have found a better documentation about the format 2 for CMap of a TrueType font.<br/>
Here is the link : http://developer.apple.com/fonts/TTRefMan/RM06/Chap6cmap.html <br/>
<br/>
In attachment you can find my implementation, however I didn&#39;t find font to test my code...<br/>
<br/>
The patch include the patch of the PDFBOX-668 task and a suggestion to send IOException instead of NullPointer during the parsing of TrueType Font if some tables are missing.<br/>
<br/>
Regards,<br/>
Eric
  </td>
