	at org.apache.pdfbox.util.PDFTextStripper.getText(PDFTextStripper.java:180)<br/>
	...<br/>
<br/>
So far, all affected pdf files are confidential. I&#39;ll add a test file later if I find one that can be made public. Hope the stack trace is sufficient though.
