                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The method normalizeDiac in org.apache.pdfbox.util.ICU4JImpl constructs a long string from individual characters.<br/>
  It should use StringBuilder instead of String.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     0%
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     0%
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
