                <tr id="issuerow12462354" rel="12462354" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-693" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-693" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-693">PDFBOX-693</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Migrate to slf4j from java.util.logging / commons logging
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sascha Szott
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sascha Szott
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 18/Apr/10 13:58 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Jul/10 15:05 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Jun/10 15:47 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Please consider a migration from java.util.logging / commons logging to slf4j.<br/>
<br/>
At the moment two different logging APIs are in use. As far as I have observed, commons logging is used as the primary logging framework with the exception of class org.apache.pdfbox.encoding.Encoding in which java.util.logging is used.<br/>
<br/>
By using slf4j, the choice of the logging API could be left up to the user.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
 
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
