                                            <td class="description">      Findbugs Scan of the code reports  code paths which may result in a null pointer reference.<br/>
<br/>
C:/workspace/ibi_apps/src/org/apache/jempbox/xmp/XMPSchema.java:570 Possible null pointer dereference of bagElement<br/>
C:/workspace/ibi_apps/src/org/apache/jempbox/xmp/XMPSchema.java:392 Possible null pointer dereference of bagElement<br/>
<br/>
The solution is to test for null before attempting to use the objects.<br/>
<br/>
A patch file is included<br/>
<br/>
Peter<br/>

