                <tr id="issuerow12463393" rel="12463393" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-711" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-711" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-711">PDFBOX-711</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Findbugs: Bug: Doomed test for equality to NaN PDFTextStripper.java
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Peter_Lenahan@ibi.com
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Peter_Lenahan@ibi.com
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Apr/10 01:11 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 14/May/11 13:00 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/May/10 06:08 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.1.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Utilities            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      org.apache.pdfbox.util.PDFTextStripper.java<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
                if ((wordSpacing == 0) || (wordSpacing == Float.NaN)) <br/>
<br/>
(wordSpacing == Float.NaN)  always fails, should use the method to test the value.<br/>
<br/>
                  if ((wordSpacing == 0) || Float.isNaN(wordSpacing ) <br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Findbugs Description: Bug: Doomed test for equality to NaN<br/>
Pattern id: FE_TEST_IF_EQUAL_TO_NOT_A_NUMBER, type: FE, category: CORRECTNESS<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
This code checks to see if a floating point value is equal to the special Not A Number value (e.g., if (x == Double.NaN)). However, because of the special semantics of NaN, no value is equal to Nan, including NaN. Thus, x == Double.NaN always evaluates to false. To check to see if a value contained in x is the special Not A Number value, use Double.isNaN(x) (or Float.isNaN(x) if x is floating point precision). <br/>

  </td>
