  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      In otherwise (more or less) correctly recognised text there appear remnants of TeX commands, e.g.<br/>
parenleftbigparenleftbigparenleftbig<br/>
Aσ̇,τ − σ<br/>
parenrightbigparenrightbigparenrightbig<br/>
+<br/>
parenleftbigparenleftbigparenleftbig<br/>
ξ̇,η − ξ<br/>
parenrightbigparenrightbigparenrightbig<br/>
that are not visible in any PDF viewer nor present if text is copied from there (tested: Acrobat Reades 9.3.2 and Preview 5.0.2).
