  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Greek text extraction error<br/>
Ι have a greek pdf but <br/>
a) after extraction the greek letter π is extracted as pi<br/>
<br/>
for expamle<br/>
original text in pdf<br/>
&quot;φυσικών προσώπων&quot;<br/>
<br/>
extracted text<br/>
&quot;φυσικών piροσώpiων&quot;<br/>
<br/>
b) the greek letter μ is displayed as µ <br/>
there is no difference in display except that is different encoding and when searching for μ cannot find it (you find only the uppercase Μ)<br/>
if you copy  μ as displayed search for that is working fine<br/>
<br/>
e.g. the word is displayed as &quot;κλίµακας&quot; but it is different from the typed word κλίμακα due to the letter μ<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
due to this problem solr is not indexing documents correctly<br/>
<br/>
is there any configuration I can make?
  </td>
