                                            <td class="description">      we tried to convert a lot of PDF files to image(e.g. tif, jpg) on two servers, it worked OK at the begging period, but after converting a cerntain quantity of PDF files, something went wrong, all the characters were drawn at the bottom of the image file. Does anyone meet this problem before?<br/>
