                                            <td class="description">      We have 2 printers, the first one is defined to print in Portrait by default in Windows, the other one is defined to print in Landscape by default in Windows.<br/>
PrintPDF does not take the default configuration into account.<br/>
<br/>
I wrote a little patch that seems to solve this bug<br/>

