                <tr id="issuerow12472848" rel="12472848" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-806" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-806" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-806">PDFBOX-806</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Failure to extract dc:description when the value is the node text
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Adam Nichols
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Staffan Olsson
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Staffan Olsson
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Aug/10 12:46 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 20/Dec/10 09:38 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/Nov/10 20:36 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JempBox            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I can not get the dc:description from the following xmpmeta:<br/>
&lt;x:xmpmeta xmlns:x=&quot;adobe:ns:meta/&quot; x:xmptk=&quot;XMP Core 4.4.0&quot;&gt;<br/>
   &lt;rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;rdf:Description rdf:about=&quot;&quot;<br/>
            xmlns:exif=&quot;http://ns.adobe.com/exif/1.0/&quot;&gt;<br/>
         &lt;exif:UserComment&gt;exif&lt;/exif:UserComment&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/rdf:Description&gt;<br/>
      &lt;rdf:Description rdf:about=&quot;&quot;<br/>
            xmlns:dc=&quot;http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/&quot;&gt;<br/>
         &lt;dc:description&gt;from XnViewMP 0.26&lt;/dc:description&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/rdf:Description&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/rdf:RDF&gt;<br/>
&lt;/x:xmpmeta&gt;<br/>
<br/>
But it works from this:<br/>
&lt;x:xmpmeta xmlns:x=&quot;adobe:ns:meta/&quot; x:xmptk=&quot;XMP Core 4.4.0-Exiv2&quot;&gt;<br/>
 &lt;rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;rdf:Description rdf:about=&quot;&quot;<br/>
    xmlns:dc=&quot;http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/&quot;&gt;<br/>
   &lt;dc:description&gt;<br/>
    &lt;rdf:Alt&gt;<br/>
     &lt;rdf:li xml:lang=&quot;x-default&quot;&gt;dc:description&lt;/rdf:li&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/rdf:Alt&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/dc:description&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/rdf:Description&gt;<br/>
 &lt;/rdf:RDF&gt;<br/>
&lt;/x:xmpmeta&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Both of them are valid according to http://www.w3.org/RDF/Validator/. My interpretation of http://dublincore.org/documents/dcmes-xml/ is that the first format should be ok for Dublin Core too.<br/>
<br/>
See attached unit test.
  </td>
