                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi all ,<br/>
<br/>
* I am very long time user of PDFBOX from 0.7.3 version.<br/>
<br/>
* Current I am using the latest version(1.2.1).<br/>
<br/>
* While using i came across the problem while extracting PDFPageLabels for PDF with roman numbers .<br/>
<br/>
* For example if the label is &quot;xi&quot; PDFBOX output is &quot;xxi&quot; and it is correct for pagenumber less than ten.<br/>
<br/>
* I made a small correction in the code PDPageLabels.java and found that it seems to work fine .<br/>
<br/>
ORIGINAL CODE IN PDPageLabels.java<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
 private static final String[][] ROMANS = new String[][]<br/>
        {<br/>
        { &quot;&quot;, &quot;i&quot;, &quot;ii&quot;, &quot;iii&quot;, &quot;iv&quot;, &quot;v&quot;, &quot;vi&quot;, &quot;vii&quot;, &quot;viii&quot;, &quot;ix&quot; },<br/>
        { &quot;x&quot;, &quot;xx&quot;, &quot;xxx&quot;, &quot;xl&quot;, &quot;l&quot;, &quot;lx&quot;, &quot;lxx&quot;, &quot;lxxx&quot;, &quot;xc&quot; },<br/>
        { &quot;c&quot;, &quot;cc&quot;, &quot;ccc&quot;, &quot;cd&quot;, &quot;d&quot;, &quot;dc&quot;, &quot;dcc&quot;, &quot;dccc&quot;, &quot;cm&quot; }, };<br/>
<br/>
 <br/>
MODIFIED CODE IN PDPageLabels.java<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
private static final String[][] ROMANS = new String[][]<br/>
        {<br/>
        { &quot;&quot;, &quot;i&quot;, &quot;ii&quot;, &quot;iii&quot;, &quot;iv&quot;, &quot;v&quot;, &quot;vi&quot;, &quot;vii&quot;, &quot;viii&quot;, &quot;ix&quot; },<br/>
        { &quot;&quot;, &quot;x&quot;, &quot;xx&quot;, &quot;xxx&quot;, &quot;xl&quot;, &quot;l&quot;, &quot;lx&quot;, &quot;lxx&quot;, &quot;lxxx&quot;, &quot;xc&quot; },<br/>
        { &quot;&quot;, &quot;c&quot;, &quot;cc&quot;, &quot;ccc&quot;, &quot;cd&quot;, &quot;d&quot;, &quot;dc&quot;, &quot;dcc&quot;, &quot;dccc&quot;, &quot;cm&quot; }, };<br/>
<br/>
*Please advice me whether the above change is correct and incorporate in my PDFBox.<br/>
<br/>
Thank You very much<br/>
<br/>
Regards<br/>
<br/>
Karthick . G<br/>
<br/>

