  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I add keywords (and other properties) via the PDDocumentInformation:<br/>
<br/>
    pddi.setKeywords(&quot;Test4711&quot;);<br/>
<br/>
The resulting PDF shows those keywords but enclosed in quotes:<br/>
<br/>
    &quot;Test4711&quot;<br/>
<br/>
instead of just the string:<br/>
<br/>
    Test4711<br/>
<br/>
Other strings I set with PDDocumentInformation are shown correctly (without quotes). I debugged my code to ensure that the string object passed to setKeywords() is correct (i.e. without any additional quotes).
