Last line in this listing has problems. It has duplicate values somehow.<br/>
You can find this issue on almost every page of this list. Other lists (that i have not uploaded) have same problems.<br/>
As i said, other file (listaMeridian.pdf) does not have this issue.<br/>
<br/>
Maybe this will help you fix this and it will surely help me. :)<br/>

