                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      A client sent me a PDF which was basically a double-sided page of which only the right side was shown by the CropBox. But PDFBox displayed the left side in the PDFReader. I&#39;ve created a minimal test case with FOP and a Hex Editor showing the problem. It seems as if the PageDrawer doesn&#39;t take the full CropBox information into account when painting the page.
