                                            <td class="environment">      Solaris 10
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi<br/>
<br/>
I am trying to use PDF box 1.2.1 version to extract text from PDF files.<br/>
The following issue is observed in the extracted text:<br/>
<br/>
1. Combination of the characters &#39;fi&#39; is converted to a &#39;?&#39;<br/>
example:  first becomes ?rst<br/>
                  classifier becomes classi?er<br/>
                  find becomes ?nd<br/>
<br/>
Is this a known bug? Can some setting of the PDF box be turned of to prevent this?<br/>
<br/>
Thanks &amp; Regards<br/>
Saurabh<br/>

  </td>
