                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
OpenSearchServer is an open source search engine hosted by SourceForge. We are using PDFBox to index PDF document using text extraction.<br/>
<br/>
Thank you to add it as a reference.<br/>
<br/>
Here are the informations you need:<br/>
Project name: OpenSearchServer www.open-search-server.com<br/>
License: GPL<br/>
Project description: An open source search engine and crawler based on best open source technologies. It is a modern search engine and a suite of high-powered full text search algorithms.<br/>
<br/>
Thank you for your wonderful tool !<br/>
<br/>
Regards,<br/>
Emmanuel Keller.
  </td>
