                <tr id="issuerow12478348" rel="12478348" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-879" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-879" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-879">PDFBOX-879</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                PDFMergerUtility
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Andreas Lehmkühler
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            MH
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            MH
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/Oct/10 15:07 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/May/12 16:21 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Dec/11 19:31 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.7.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Utilities            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      JDK 1.6.0_22
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I concatenate PDFs with the PDFMergerUtility. As long as I concat my (with FOP) created PDFs that are in &quot;PDF 1.4&quot; format, I get no issue when viewing the result. But when one of the PDFs is a &quot;PDF 1.2&quot; document, the resulting PDF will also have &quot;PDF 1.2&quot; version. When viewing this concatenated PDF in Acrobat Reader (9), the first (originally PDF-1.2) document gets viewed without errors, but as soon as I scroll further to the second page (with the other PDF-1.4 PDFs), I get errors like<br/>
<br/>
&quot;Fehler auf dieser Seite. Die Seite wird unter Umständen nicht richtig in Acrobat angezeigt. Wenden Sie sich an den Ersteller des PDF-Dokuments, um das Problem zu beheben.&quot; (Roughly: errors on this page.)<br/>
<br/>
or<br/>
<br/>
&quot;Ungültiger Parameter.&quot; (Roughly: invalid parameter.)<br/>
<br/>
Note: when concatenated with iText 2.1.7, the resulting PDF has version &quot;1.4&quot; and no errors occur in Adobe Reader.<br/>
<br/>
Is it possible to tell the merger to set the PDF Version of the result PDF?
  </td>
