  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;ve just upgraded PDFBox from 1.2.1 to 1.3.1 and special characters (like &#39;é&#39;, &#39;°&#39;, &#39;à&#39;, ...) are not correctly handled anymore when printing or exporting to image. These characters are remplaced by &#39;Ø&#39; or blank spaces. Everything was working flawlessly with PDFBox 1.2.1.
