                <tr id="issuerow12480467" rel="12480467" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-897" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-897" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-897">PDFBOX-897</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                NullPointerException PDFFont#getEncodingFromFont with a PDF book because Type1Encoding is null
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Adam Nichols
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Martijn Brinkers
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Martijn Brinkers
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Nov/10 23:45 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 20/Dec/10 09:38 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/Nov/10 21:15 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Parsing            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      A NullPointerException was thrown while extracting text from a PDF ebook. The exception was thrown in<br/>
<br/>
PDFFont#getEncodingFromFont  line:<br/>
<br/>
[snip]<br/>
encoding.addCharacterEncoding(index, name.replace(&quot;/&quot;, &quot;&quot;));<br/>
[snip]<br/>
<br/>
encoding was null. The line that was scanned was &quot;/Encoding 256 array 0 1 255 {1 index exch /.notdef put} for&quot;. The array check however only checks for line.endsWith(&quot;array&quot;). The NPE was fixed when using line.contains(&quot;array&quot;) instead. <br/>
<br/>
I have added a patch. The PDF is a PDF book with copyright so it cannot be attached as an example. The meta data of the document was:<br/>
<br/>
Acrobat Distiller 7.0 (Windows)<br/>
PScript5.dll Version 5.2.2<br/>
PDF-1.6
  </td>
