  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am running alfresco on tomcat 6.0.18... when customers are open the pdf file.. it&#39;s opening &amp; showing the data. he minimize the pdf for certain period(20min) of time &amp; reopen it shows that white screen in the PDF.<br/>
<br/>
  People are connected to Alfresco CIFS drive.. when click on the properties from the file&gt;properties, it is not showing i.e, it is disconnecting from the server.. why pdf opened from the CIFS drive, why it is not buffering the pdf data to client location?<br/>
<br/>
I got the following error in the log:<br/>
<br/>
   [private] ERROR [org.apache.pdfbox.pdmodel.font.PDFont] Error: Could not parse predefined CMAP file for &#39;Zeon-Identity-0&#39; <br/>
