                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Creating a link without borders appears with borders in Mac&#39;s Preview
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Andreas Lehmkühler
    </td>
