                                            <td class="description">      I used PDFBox to add text into existing PDF documents (kind of text stamping).<br/>
For some pages of PDF, the space/gap between letters/characters of the text is much wider !<br/>
I cannot explain how/why it happens ?!<br/>
<br/>
Sample of my code:<br/>
<br/>
contentStream.beginText();<br/>
contentStream.setNonStrokingColor(colorText);<br/>
contentStream.setFont(pdfFont, fontSize);<br/>
contentStream.moveTextPositionByAmount(xText, yText);<br/>
contentStream.drawString(messageStamp);<br/>
contentStream.endText();<br/>

  </td>
