                <tr id="issuerow12502346" rel="12502346" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-988" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-988" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-988">PDFBOX-988</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                pdmodel.font.PDSimpleFont hanging on TrueType font (ubuntu)
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Andreas Lehmkühler
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Craig Stires
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Craig Stires
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/Mar/11 03:40 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/16 19:06 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 09/Aug/13 18:02 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.5.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        PDModel            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        PDFBOX-723,                                                PDFBOX-1019                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Ubuntu 8.04 - Headless
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When calling PDPage.convertToImage(imagetype,resolution) , I have found a case where the application hangs.  No error messages, no exceptions, no CPU spike, no I/O.  The error had to do with some strange corruption of the awtFont, by the time it reached the method PDSimpleFont.drawString.  Some pretty deep digging turned up that if a font with too few glyphs is sent into PDSimpleFont.writeFont, it will enter Graphics2D.drawString ... ne&#39;er to return.<br/>
<br/>
If a check is done to count the glyphs and if they fall below a certain threshold, then just re-instantiate the Font, then all goes well.  Typical numbers range from 70 to 1000+, so I&#39;ve gone with an arbitrary value of 40.  All goes well, and I can&#39;t measure any difference in performance (except that my app will actually return from attempting this doc!).<br/>
<br/>
Attached is a sample PDF which can re-create the problem, and a patch which seems to solve it sensibly.<br/>

  </td>
