</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Image transparency lost when drawing an image (during pdf to image conversion)
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Andreas Lehmkühler
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jesse Eichar
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jesse Eichar
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Mar/11 14:37 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 02/Jul/11 16:28 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Apr/11 15:22 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.5.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.6.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      My scenario is converting an existing PDF to an image.  When the PDF contains an image with transparency the transparency is lost and the image is drawn at 100% opacity.<br/>
<br/>
This fix is related (and depends on) the issue:  https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-975  <br/>
<br/>
All that is needed is to set the composite of the graphics before drawing the image as specified in the graphics state (See attached patch)<br/>
<br/>
Note:  line number in patch maybe off since it was created from 1.5.0 but after fixing 975.
