                <tr id="issuerow12504621" rel="12504621" data-issuekey="PDFBOX-998" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    PDFBox
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="PDFBOX-998" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PDFBOX-998">PDFBOX-998</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                java.io.IOException: Error: End-of-File, expected line when opening PDF file
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Blocker
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Yann-Gaël Guéhéneuc
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Yann-Gaël Guéhéneuc
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Apr/11 02:59 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Mar/13 13:05 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 19/Apr/11 03:02 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.5.0            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Swing GUI            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows 7 64bits
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hello,<br/>
<br/>
I am new to PDFBox. I just downloaded PDFBox v1.5.0. I created a project in Eclipse and used as source folder the content of pdfbox-1.5.0/pdfbox/src/main/java extracted from the ZIP file: pdfbox-1.5.0-src.zip. To compile the source code, I added to my projects the JARs:<br/>
- fontbox-1.5.0.jar<br/>
- jempbox-1.5.0.jar<br/>
